@reactions event.ionStorm.resolution
// EW1 (events writer), the storm update: Sunday Day 14 (the all-clear at 10:00, the booths' rush, the party at 19:00).
? cue:event.ionStorm.resolution
- Talent night's moved to next week. Tonight's for the party.
- The lounge is open again. I'm going to sit in every chair.   #funny

// EW2 (events writer 2), story A "Sixty by lamplight": the crew retell the lantern supper on Sunday
? cue:event.ionStorm.resolution !who:dlamini-lukas
- Lukas's lantern supper: two rings. Or six. Ask around.   #funny
? cue:event.ionStorm.resolution dept:galley !who:brennan|dlamini-lukas
- Supper was all Lukas. We carried bowls and kept quiet.   #warm
? cue:event.ionStorm.resolution who:varga-tariq
- Lukas fed sixty-one. Still slower than me at onions.   #funny
? cue:event.ionStorm.resolution who:brennan
- Back in my galley. Pans nearly where I left them. Nearly.   #funny
